{"id":73636,"date":"2026-11-10T07:00:45","date_gmt":"2026-11-10T07:00:45","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=73636"},"modified":"2026-11-10T08:05:23","modified_gmt":"2026-11-10T07:05:23","slug":"corrida-sao-silvestre-dos-madeiros","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-sao-silvestre-dos-madeiros\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre dos Madeiros 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre dos Madeiros 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre dos Madeiros 2026<\/strong> (12\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>20 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e meta no <strong>Parque da Quinta do Moinho Velho<\/strong> (Rua Bairro Disco de Cima, n\u00ba 15), em <strong>Castelo Branco<\/strong>. A jornada desportiva arranca \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> com os escal\u00f5es jovens e a Caminhada dos Madeiros, seguindo-se \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong> a partida da prova principal.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O evento celebra a tradi\u00e7\u00e3o albicastrense dos madeiros de Natal, levando o pelot\u00e3o da corrida principal de <strong>9,4 km<\/strong> (duas voltas em piso misto de cal\u00e7ada de granito e betuminoso) a passar pelos tr\u00eas madeiros emblem\u00e1ticos da cidade: o <strong>Madeiro do Cansado<\/strong>, o <strong>Madeiro da S\u00e9<\/strong> e o <strong>Madeiro do Esp\u00edrito Santo<\/strong>. O programa inclui ainda uma Meta Volante ao km 3 (junto \u00e0 Junta de Freguesia de Castelo Branco), a <strong>Caminhada dos Madeiros<\/strong> e quatro percursos gratuitos dedicados \u00e0 forma\u00e7\u00e3o (<strong>3,3 km<\/strong> para Sub-18, <strong>2,6 km<\/strong> para Sub-16, <strong>1,3 km<\/strong> para Sub-14 e <strong>620 m<\/strong> para Sub-12).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural, Recreativa e Desportiva do Bairro do Cansado<\/strong>, com o apoio do Munic\u00edpio de Castelo Branco, da equipa ABCansadoTrail e ajuizamento t\u00e9cnico da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Castelo Branco. No final da prova, o conv\u00edvio natal\u00edcio \u00e9 assinalado com sopa tradicional, filh\u00f3s e cacau quente para os participantes. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">20 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Parque da Quinta do Moinho Velho, Castelo Branco<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr